sequenceDiagram
    participant P0 as Source
    participant P1 as Adapter
    participant P2 as Import worker
    participant P3 as PostgreSQL
    participant P4 as Owner
    participant P5 as API
    participant P6 as Objective service
    P0->>P1: S01 Event or bounded scheduled source check
    P1->>P2: S02 Bind connection workload source version raw digest and successful check time
    alt S02 accepted
        Note over P2: Continue only with accepted scoped context
    else denied, stale or incomplete
        break F1 stop this path
            Note over P2: Retain restrictive disposition; no later success steps
        end
    end
    P2->>P2: S03 Validate mappings units windows comparison coverage and authoritative withdrawal
    alt S03 accepted
        Note over P2: Continue only with accepted scoped context
    else denied, stale or incomplete
        break F1 stop this path
            Note over P2: Retain restrictive disposition; no later success steps
        end
    end
    P2->>P3: S04 Deduplicate immutable candidate and checkpoint in an atomic transaction
    P4->>P5: S05 Read scoped candidate history and source local base comparison
    alt S05 accepted
        Note over P5: Continue only with accepted scoped context
    else denied, stale or incomplete
        break F1 stop this path
            Note over P5: Retain restrictive disposition; no later success steps
        end
    end
    P4->>P5: S06 Choose keep local propose source or detach with expected revisions and reason
    P5->>P5: S07 Recheck current grants source digest binding version and local revision
    alt S07 accepted
        Note over P5: Continue only with accepted scoped context
    else denied, stale or incomplete
        break F1 stop this path
            Note over P5: Retain restrictive disposition; no later success steps
        end
    end
    P5->>P3: S08 Atomically retain resolution history audit outbox and any proposal link
    P4->>P6: S09 If PROPOSE_SOURCE continue EXT-01 independent submission review and activation
    Note over P0,P6: F1 Invalid incomplete or conflicting data remains quarantined or unresolved. KEEP_LOCAL and DETACH_SOURCE do not activate a new objective. A stale source requires new review.
